WEBVTT

01:24.880 --> 01:30.240
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:34.040 --> 01:35.120
Get to work.

01:35.200 --> 01:36.560
Master Shijiu.

01:36.640 --> 01:37.560
Survival is paramount.

01:38.240 --> 01:39.520
Hurry.

01:39.600 --> 01:40.880
Hurry.

01:40.960 --> 01:42.320
Go over there. Go.

01:43.520 --> 01:45.200
-Pick it up.
-Hurry.

01:47.600 --> 01:49.360
What are you doing?

01:50.320 --> 01:51.680
Go.

01:51.760 --> 01:52.720
Hurry.

01:54.120 --> 01:55.200
Hurry.

01:56.160 --> 01:57.360
Hurry.

02:00.080 --> 02:01.400
Don't slack off!

02:01.480 --> 02:02.640
What is it with you?

02:07.400 --> 02:09.880
Did the agents follow us
when we were brought in?

02:09.960 --> 02:11.080
Yes.

02:12.200 --> 02:13.240
Save them first.

02:13.320 --> 02:15.840
They were witnesses
to the Black Dragon Bandits' crimes.

02:16.720 --> 02:18.120
-Okay.
-Hurry.

02:30.000 --> 02:31.040
Hurry.

02:31.120 --> 02:32.800
Who told you to slack off?

02:32.880 --> 02:33.880
Hurry.

02:36.800 --> 02:38.280
Murder.

02:42.480 --> 02:43.720
Supervisor Kang.

03:05.600 --> 03:06.720
Duanwu.

03:06.800 --> 03:08.400
Come with me. There's no more time.

03:08.480 --> 03:10.280
-Come with me.
-Go.

03:11.400 --> 03:13.560
-Go.
-Go!

03:18.680 --> 03:21.200
Go. There's no more time.

03:21.280 --> 03:22.480
I'm not leaving.

03:22.560 --> 03:23.800
We can't leave.

03:23.880 --> 03:25.240
Even if we get out of here,

03:25.320 --> 03:28.960
they'll behead us.

03:31.200 --> 03:32.720
Duanwu, come on.

03:32.800 --> 03:34.440
Go. Ask them to leave.

03:34.520 --> 03:36.120
There's no more time. Go.

03:36.200 --> 03:37.400
Listen to me. Go.

03:37.480 --> 03:38.920
Come on. Let's go.

03:39.000 --> 03:40.160
Tan, come on.

03:40.240 --> 03:41.480
Go.

03:41.560 --> 03:44.560
Guys. This is the family head's token
of the Cui family.

03:44.640 --> 03:47.000
I'm Cui Shijiu,
the legitimate daughter of the Cui family.

03:47.600 --> 03:50.040
The Wuling Mine belongs to my family.

03:50.120 --> 03:52.200
Master Eight is guilty of great crimes.

03:52.280 --> 03:54.160
My family won't let him go.

03:54.240 --> 03:55.240
I promise

03:56.120 --> 03:57.720
I'll let you go

03:58.240 --> 04:00.520
when we get out of the mine,

04:00.600 --> 04:01.760
and I won't hold you accountable.

04:06.200 --> 04:07.680
Go.

04:09.240 --> 04:10.200
The Cui family head's token.

04:10.280 --> 04:11.400
CUI

04:12.520 --> 04:15.000
We're saved.

04:15.080 --> 04:16.920
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

04:17.000 --> 04:19.040
Go.

04:19.120 --> 04:21.880
-Go.
-Go.

04:23.280 --> 04:24.760
Go. Keep up.

04:24.840 --> 04:26.240
Hurry. Keep up.

04:46.320 --> 04:47.440
Hurry.

04:50.880 --> 04:52.280
Hurry.

04:52.360 --> 04:53.400
I'll take them away.

04:53.480 --> 04:55.640
-Hurry.
-Hurry.

04:56.560 --> 04:57.520
Hurry.

04:58.200 --> 04:59.440
-Come with me.
-Go.

05:00.560 --> 05:01.600
Go.

05:17.600 --> 05:18.560
Hurry.

05:18.640 --> 05:19.960
Don't let her get away.

05:21.080 --> 05:22.000
This way.

05:25.920 --> 05:27.480
This way. Hurry.

06:07.720 --> 06:08.800
Yan Zijing.

06:17.440 --> 06:18.280
Duanwu.

06:18.920 --> 06:20.080
Don't come over. The water is toxic.

06:20.680 --> 06:22.160
The agents followed me
when I was brought here.

06:22.840 --> 06:24.680
They'll be here in a minute.
I can keep it up.

06:31.040 --> 06:33.960
Duanwu. The water is toxic.
Don't come over, Duanwu.

06:41.440 --> 06:42.480
I'm coming.

06:44.600 --> 06:45.680
I'm coming.

06:47.680 --> 06:48.920
I'm coming.

06:51.760 --> 06:52.680
Come on.

07:01.280 --> 07:02.640
Are you all right?

07:02.720 --> 07:03.840
You are being foolish.

07:07.840 --> 07:09.200
Let's go. Go.

07:12.320 --> 07:13.400
Be careful.

07:23.040 --> 07:24.200
Be careful.

07:25.280 --> 07:26.440
It's okay. Let's go.

07:38.600 --> 07:39.760
Are you okay?

07:39.840 --> 07:40.800
How are you doing, Duanwu?

07:42.320 --> 07:43.360
Duanwu.

07:48.520 --> 07:49.560
Let's go.

08:03.320 --> 08:04.880
It's you again.

08:04.960 --> 08:06.520
Good for you.

08:11.480 --> 08:12.680
What?

08:12.760 --> 08:13.800
Did you get into the water, too?

08:17.080 --> 08:18.400
In that case,

08:19.600 --> 08:21.000
I'll give you a ride.

08:39.840 --> 08:41.960
Yan Zijing.

09:21.400 --> 09:22.240
Duanwu.

09:22.320 --> 09:23.560
Chancellor Zhang.

09:23.640 --> 09:25.520
The Bafang Tower
has always been law-abiding.

09:25.600 --> 09:27.640
Governor Sun,
you avoided me all night last night

09:27.720 --> 09:30.000
to stop me from coming here, right?

09:30.080 --> 09:32.600
Whether the Bafang Tower is law-abiding

09:32.680 --> 09:33.840
or not,

09:33.920 --> 09:35.920
we will find out when we go in.

09:38.320 --> 09:39.720
Open the door for Chancellor Zhang.

09:39.800 --> 09:41.160
BAFANG TOWER

09:41.240 --> 09:42.280
Open the door.

09:48.880 --> 09:49.720
I'm Zhang Jinran,

09:49.800 --> 09:51.760
a chancellor of the Institute
for Advancement of Literature.

09:54.200 --> 09:56.880
Mr. Zhang, Governor Sun.

09:57.600 --> 09:58.920
What are you doing here

09:59.680 --> 10:01.080
with so many soldiers?

10:01.160 --> 10:03.280
We came to you for a trading convoy.

10:03.360 --> 10:05.640
Trading convoy? What do you mean?

10:05.720 --> 10:07.200
I've never heard of it.

10:12.800 --> 10:13.960
I'll ask you again.

10:14.040 --> 10:15.440
Where is the Yan's Trading Convoy now?

10:16.440 --> 10:17.760
Governor Sun.

10:17.840 --> 10:20.120
He came to my Bafang Tower
to make trouble.

10:20.840 --> 10:22.360
What are you going to do with him?

10:22.440 --> 10:23.520
Um…

10:24.880 --> 10:29.000
I give away porridge and medicine
and fight bandits in Wuling.

10:29.720 --> 10:31.000
I'm a good person.

10:32.040 --> 10:33.840
You're a scholar-official.

10:33.920 --> 10:36.440
What right do you have to pick on me?

10:36.520 --> 10:37.480
What did you say?

10:37.560 --> 10:40.200
I'm the governor of Wuling.

10:40.280 --> 10:42.080
Mr. Zhang, I'll report back to you

10:42.160 --> 10:44.400
when I've looked into it, okay?

10:46.720 --> 10:48.240
If you'd looked into it,

10:49.320 --> 10:51.120
Wuling wouldn't be like this.

10:51.200 --> 10:53.080
I'm telling you. If you mess with me,

10:53.160 --> 10:54.760
Wuling will be in chaos.

10:56.040 --> 10:58.680
Can you afford the consequences?

10:58.760 --> 11:01.040
Wuling belongs to Tang.

11:01.120 --> 11:02.720
Who are you?

11:03.720 --> 11:05.320
-You…
-Stop.

11:05.400 --> 11:07.880
Calm down.

11:08.560 --> 11:09.440
You…

11:15.200 --> 11:16.240
Give me the antidote.

11:20.720 --> 11:22.440
Here. Take it.

12:12.040 --> 12:13.200
Can you walk?

12:14.040 --> 12:15.320
Help her.

12:15.400 --> 12:16.640
Help her.

12:23.360 --> 12:24.640
Let's get out of here.

12:53.360 --> 12:55.200
You should have thought of today

12:55.280 --> 12:57.280
when you betrayed the Cui family.

12:58.640 --> 13:00.280
It's my mercy

13:01.400 --> 13:02.760
just to kill you.

13:37.520 --> 13:38.560
Master Eight.

13:39.560 --> 13:40.600
What do you want to say?

13:40.680 --> 13:43.720
The man in blue
is Chancellor Zhang from Chang'an.

13:43.800 --> 13:45.320
You can go to him to seek justice.

13:46.120 --> 13:48.720
They robbed and killed merchants,
imprisoned the innocent,

13:48.800 --> 13:50.120
forced good girls to become prostitutes,

13:50.200 --> 13:52.080
and used lynching to kill people.

13:52.160 --> 13:53.360
No.

13:53.440 --> 13:54.920
They are my slaves.

13:55.000 --> 13:56.440
They signed contracts to sell themselves.

13:56.520 --> 13:58.200
They sold themselves to me.

13:58.280 --> 13:59.240
-No.
-That's not true.

13:59.320 --> 14:00.200
Nonsense.

14:00.280 --> 14:01.800
We are merchants of the Cuiyu House.

14:01.880 --> 14:04.080
I'm a worker at the Cuiyu House.

14:04.160 --> 14:04.920
We were captured

14:05.000 --> 14:06.440
by the Black Dragon Bandits
in Western Regions.

14:06.520 --> 14:09.120
They took our money and delivered us here.

14:15.480 --> 14:18.040
Duanwu. You go back first.

14:23.040 --> 14:24.560
The witnesses are here.

14:25.200 --> 14:26.280
As for physical evidence,

14:26.360 --> 14:28.200
I think they are all over
the Bafang Tower.

14:29.200 --> 14:30.600
The murderer will be beheaded.

14:31.280 --> 14:32.760
The looters will be hanged.

14:33.640 --> 14:35.080
Besides, you colluded
with the Black Dragon Bandits.

14:35.160 --> 14:36.560
You're doubly guilty.

14:37.280 --> 14:38.360
Governor Sun.

14:39.280 --> 14:40.320
Governor Sun.

14:41.520 --> 14:42.480
We caught him red-handed
with robbed goods.

14:42.560 --> 14:43.640
Come on.

14:43.720 --> 14:45.440
Arrest him for interrogation.

14:45.960 --> 14:49.000
Wait. Governor Sun, I'm innocent.

14:49.080 --> 14:50.960
The head of the Cui family did all this.

14:51.040 --> 14:53.720
I was ordered.

14:53.800 --> 14:55.080
Cui Shijiu.

14:55.160 --> 14:56.920
You can't get away with this.

14:57.000 --> 14:58.040
Nonsense.

14:58.640 --> 15:00.280
How dare you slander the head?

15:01.040 --> 15:03.320
The Cui family didn't know
you did all this.

15:03.400 --> 15:04.920
It's all your fault.

15:05.000 --> 15:06.520
To cover up your crimes,

15:07.360 --> 15:09.640
you sent me to the mine to become a miner.

15:09.720 --> 15:11.560
Everybody knows that.

15:11.640 --> 15:12.960
That's right.

15:13.040 --> 15:15.360
She's the Cui's legitimate daughter.

15:15.440 --> 15:17.000
She was sent to the mine.

15:17.080 --> 15:19.400
She took out the Cui family head's token

15:19.480 --> 15:20.840
and set us free.

15:20.920 --> 15:23.960
Punish Master Eight severely.

15:24.040 --> 15:25.360
Punish Master Eight severely.

15:25.440 --> 15:28.960
That's right. The Wuling Mine
belongs to the Cui family.

15:29.040 --> 15:32.520
I didn't expect it
to become Master Eight's prison.

15:32.600 --> 15:34.120
He's unforgivable.

15:34.200 --> 15:36.320
Fortunately,
I banished him from the Cui family

15:36.400 --> 15:37.840
with the family head's token

15:37.920 --> 15:39.040
and set everyone free.

15:41.360 --> 15:44.280
We're willing to cooperate with you

15:44.840 --> 15:46.880
to find all the evidence
of Master Eight's crimes.

15:47.920 --> 15:48.800
Cui Shijiu.

15:51.200 --> 15:52.760
You're just a dirty billet.

15:52.840 --> 15:54.360
Enough. Take him away.

15:55.240 --> 15:56.120
-Go.
-Go.

15:56.200 --> 15:58.760
Cui Jingchu, you're evil.

15:58.840 --> 16:00.960
The Cui family is doomed.

16:01.040 --> 16:02.480
You're all evil.

16:03.360 --> 16:04.400
Governor Sun.

16:05.120 --> 16:06.280
Won't you go back to try the case?

16:06.960 --> 16:08.840
Yes. I'll try the case
as soon as I get back.

16:08.920 --> 16:09.760
Let's go.

16:10.760 --> 16:13.280
Are you going with me?

16:13.960 --> 16:15.160
I'm a witness. I have to go.

16:16.280 --> 16:17.160
Let's go.

16:17.240 --> 16:20.040
Chancellor Zhang,
thank you for saving our lives.

16:20.920 --> 16:24.600
Chancellor Zhang,
thank you for saving our lives.

16:29.600 --> 16:30.880
Sir, get up.

16:31.720 --> 16:32.600
Get up.

16:32.680 --> 16:35.640
It's our job to get rid of bad people

16:35.720 --> 16:37.800
and let the people live a safe life.

16:39.880 --> 16:41.760
You're free.

16:43.520 --> 16:44.440
Live well

16:45.760 --> 16:46.880
in the future.

16:47.880 --> 16:51.320
-Thank you, Chancellor Zhang.
-Thank you, Chancellor Zhang.

16:54.000 --> 16:58.840
TAOHUA INN

17:23.240 --> 17:24.319
You're awake.

17:27.640 --> 17:28.720
Be careful.

17:32.840 --> 17:34.400
Are you feeling better?

17:35.440 --> 17:36.760
Yes.

17:44.040 --> 17:45.040
Be careful. It's hot.

18:00.520 --> 18:01.440
Are you all right?

18:05.560 --> 18:06.560
Great.

18:13.120 --> 18:14.160
You want to ask me

18:15.200 --> 18:17.480
what was going on,

18:17.560 --> 18:18.920
right?

18:19.800 --> 18:21.120
Did you plan this?

18:22.200 --> 18:24.680
Yes and no.

18:25.280 --> 18:26.800
I knew

18:26.880 --> 18:29.120
that the Black Dragon Bandits
robbed money and sold people.

18:29.200 --> 18:31.360
But I didn't know where they sold people.

18:32.160 --> 18:33.960
Mr. Yue told me

18:34.040 --> 18:35.440
that Master Eight

18:36.040 --> 18:37.760
introduced the Black Dragon Bandits
to the Cui family.

18:37.840 --> 18:38.760
I thought

18:39.280 --> 18:41.720
there must be something wrong
with Master Eight

18:41.800 --> 18:43.200
and the Bafang Tower.

18:43.280 --> 18:44.200
Then what?

18:44.280 --> 18:46.920
When we arrived in Wuling, I discovered

18:47.000 --> 18:48.120
that the mine was secretive.

18:48.880 --> 18:50.360
So, I thought

18:50.440 --> 18:51.920
that the people
sold by the Black Dragon Bandits

18:52.000 --> 18:53.520
had something to do with Master Eight

18:53.600 --> 18:54.840
and that they were most likely

18:54.920 --> 18:57.600
hidden in the Wuling Mine by Master Eight.

18:58.800 --> 19:00.880
Master Eight
took the Bafang Tower seriously.

19:01.640 --> 19:03.880
I thought the Bafang Tower was the key.

19:03.960 --> 19:06.000
So, I asked Kang Ju to look into it.

19:06.080 --> 19:07.440
He investigated for a long time

19:07.520 --> 19:09.120
but could not find
the entrance to the mine.

19:10.280 --> 19:13.400
You asked Supervisor Kang
to transfer the jewelry.

19:13.480 --> 19:16.280
I wanted to take advantage
of Master Eight's greed

19:16.360 --> 19:18.320
to lure him to attack Cui's Jewelry

19:18.400 --> 19:19.240
and me.

19:20.880 --> 19:21.880
You put yourself at risk.

19:24.120 --> 19:25.040
Yes.

19:25.120 --> 19:27.160
You lured Master Eight to take you away,

19:27.960 --> 19:30.880
so you could find the mine entrance

19:32.200 --> 19:33.280
and rescue all the miners.

19:36.080 --> 19:37.040
What's wrong?

19:37.800 --> 19:39.200
If you had made

19:41.000 --> 19:41.920
one wrong move

19:43.520 --> 19:46.120
in your plan, you would have died.

19:46.200 --> 19:48.680
I've always been a man with nothing.

19:48.760 --> 19:49.800
All these years,

19:50.800 --> 19:53.400
I got this far because I took risks.

19:53.480 --> 19:54.880
I'm blessed.

19:59.440 --> 20:01.640
But I didn't expect one thing to happen.

20:03.880 --> 20:05.160
I didn't expect you

20:07.920 --> 20:09.160
to come back to save me.

20:09.240 --> 20:10.760
Do you think

20:13.000 --> 20:14.240
I will leave you alone?

20:19.800 --> 20:20.960
Yan Zijing.

20:25.200 --> 20:27.200
I know you were alone before.

20:28.880 --> 20:30.240
You didn't care about yourself.

20:31.040 --> 20:32.960
But I want to tell you.

20:33.040 --> 20:35.280
I hope you don't put yourself
in danger again.

20:35.360 --> 20:37.160
You're not alone.

20:39.120 --> 20:40.120
I'm there for you.

20:42.280 --> 20:43.760
I'll always be there for you.

20:47.120 --> 20:48.240
Promise me.

20:54.680 --> 20:55.560
Okay.

20:57.480 --> 20:58.560
I promise you.

21:28.760 --> 21:30.040
I will protect you.

21:32.400 --> 21:33.240
I mean it.

21:38.320 --> 21:39.280
Okay.

22:15.960 --> 22:17.320
The door is open.

22:17.400 --> 22:19.200
-What is it?
-Mr. Zhang is here.

22:20.800 --> 22:22.000
Okay.

22:23.120 --> 22:24.320
I'll ask him to wait.

22:24.400 --> 22:25.960
I'll go.

22:26.040 --> 22:27.240
I'll go.

22:37.200 --> 22:40.240
You're old enough
to think about your marriage.

22:48.640 --> 22:49.520
Supervisor Kang.

22:51.440 --> 22:52.440
Mr. Zhang.

22:53.280 --> 22:54.400
Mr. Yan, how are you?

22:55.320 --> 22:57.240
Don't worry. I'm all right.

22:59.960 --> 23:01.680
Mr. Zhang,
what do you want to see me about?

23:02.680 --> 23:04.360
The Wuling miners said

23:05.360 --> 23:07.520
they were taken from the Piti Spring.

23:08.840 --> 23:10.960
Have you ever been there?

23:12.280 --> 23:13.600
I think I've been there.

23:13.680 --> 23:16.320
Sixteen years ago,
Kang paid a national tribute,

23:16.400 --> 23:17.400
which was a Lotus Terrace Apsaras statue.

23:17.480 --> 23:19.840
It was robbed there.

23:19.920 --> 23:22.680
Yangzhou Yan family volunteered

23:22.760 --> 23:24.360
to escort the national tribute,

23:24.440 --> 23:26.680
but they were involved.
Their family was ruined,

23:26.760 --> 23:28.480
and they became court criminals.

23:30.800 --> 23:32.000
Mr. Zhang, what are you trying to say?

23:35.280 --> 23:36.360
From Hepu to Guangzhou,

23:37.160 --> 23:38.960
from Shaozhou to Wuling,

23:39.040 --> 23:40.960
you used me as a pawn and got me involved.

23:41.560 --> 23:43.880
You should let me know the truth.

23:46.200 --> 23:48.240
Don't you already know the truth?

23:48.320 --> 23:50.760
The Yan's national tribute case
was suspicious.

23:50.840 --> 23:52.320
I want to look into it.

23:57.720 --> 23:59.280
It's been so many years.

24:00.200 --> 24:01.880
Is it necessary to find out the truth?

24:01.960 --> 24:04.200
I don't care how many years have passed.
I want to find out the truth.

24:07.600 --> 24:08.720
Mr. Yan, don't worry.

24:09.720 --> 24:12.400
I will investigate this case

24:13.040 --> 24:14.120
with justice.

24:18.160 --> 24:21.120
Mr. Zhang, I thank you

24:22.400 --> 24:24.680
for those who died unjustly.

24:27.120 --> 24:28.640
There's one more thing.

24:31.360 --> 24:32.640
Mr. Yan,

24:33.720 --> 24:34.720
would you help me?

24:36.080 --> 24:37.200
How?

24:37.280 --> 24:39.360
Hexi Black Dragon Bandits
has been raging for many years.

24:39.440 --> 24:40.600
They robbed countless people.

24:41.360 --> 24:43.680
I want to request troops
to eliminate the Black Dragon Bandits.

24:46.520 --> 24:49.040
The Black Dragon Bandits
disappeared for a while.

24:49.120 --> 24:50.920
They've been rampant in recent years.

24:51.880 --> 24:55.280
The government couldn't deal
with the desert.

24:55.800 --> 24:57.600
That's why they became a bully in Hexi.

24:57.680 --> 25:00.000
Many people died on the business road.

25:00.080 --> 25:01.760
If you want to do this,

25:02.400 --> 25:04.280
I'm afraid you will encounter
a lot of difficulties.

25:04.360 --> 25:07.800
Pei Shijie,
the inspector of Hexi, is my friend.

25:07.880 --> 25:09.360
I'm sure

25:09.440 --> 25:10.880
he will help us.

25:13.800 --> 25:14.680
Okay.

25:15.240 --> 25:17.960
I'll work with you on this.

25:18.640 --> 25:21.680
May we succeed

25:21.760 --> 25:22.800
in our common goal.

25:27.240 --> 25:29.120
You're doing much better than before.

25:30.000 --> 25:31.080
Come on.

25:40.560 --> 25:41.480
Watch your hands.

25:43.520 --> 25:45.120
-Mr. Zhang.
-Duanwu.

25:47.040 --> 25:49.200
-He…
-He's taking a rest.

25:56.640 --> 25:57.640
Ms. Yue,

25:58.680 --> 25:59.960
aren't your hands all right?

26:02.800 --> 26:05.000
In my friend Pei Shijie's army,

26:05.080 --> 26:07.240
there's a military physician
who's good at treating hands.

26:07.320 --> 26:08.760
Maybe you can go to him.

26:08.840 --> 26:10.360
Really?

26:10.960 --> 26:12.360
I'm going to the Hexi Army.

26:12.960 --> 26:14.920
If you trust me,

26:15.000 --> 26:16.680
I can take Ms. Yue

26:16.760 --> 26:17.960
to see the military physician.

26:26.280 --> 26:27.680
All right. Thank you, Mr. Zhang.

26:29.200 --> 26:30.600
Thank you, Mr. Zhang.

26:30.680 --> 26:32.160
Not at all.

26:32.240 --> 26:34.360
Are you also going to the Western Regions?

26:35.280 --> 26:36.120
Yes.

26:36.720 --> 26:38.320
I know the truth.

26:38.920 --> 26:40.680
I can't let it go.

26:40.760 --> 26:42.080
Mr. Zhang.

26:42.960 --> 26:44.760
Would you like to play with us?

26:44.840 --> 26:46.160
Okay, wait for me.

26:46.240 --> 26:47.360
Okay.

26:50.120 --> 26:50.960
Mr. Zhang.

26:53.680 --> 26:55.000
Thank you.

27:00.280 --> 27:01.280
Duanwu.

27:02.440 --> 27:03.640
Could you give me an orange?

27:08.000 --> 27:09.080
Catch it.

27:13.800 --> 27:16.600
It's sweet. Cao Da, eat one.

27:21.800 --> 27:23.360
Sit down, everybody.

27:29.680 --> 27:30.680
Come here, Shrimp.

27:31.720 --> 27:33.920
Come on. Sit down.

27:45.040 --> 27:46.320
In Wuling,

27:46.920 --> 27:48.400
our trading convoy encountered a disaster.

27:48.480 --> 27:50.280
Thank you for not leaving.

27:51.280 --> 27:52.720
I've been in business for years.

27:53.720 --> 27:56.200
I have always acted freely.
I have enemies everywhere.

27:57.360 --> 28:00.280
So, sometimes, I don't do things

28:00.360 --> 28:01.280
according to common sense.

28:02.480 --> 28:06.440
This will happen a lot in the future.

28:06.520 --> 28:08.120
I'm going to Hexi next.

28:08.200 --> 28:10.680
If you have scruples

28:10.760 --> 28:12.960
or want to do something else,

28:13.040 --> 28:14.280
you can leave.

28:14.960 --> 28:16.480
I won't force you to stay.

28:16.560 --> 28:17.840
I prepared

28:19.360 --> 28:21.200
a year's salary
for those who want to leave

28:22.040 --> 28:23.080
as compensation.

28:24.120 --> 28:25.240
So much money.

28:27.320 --> 28:28.920
I'll follow you, Master.

28:37.040 --> 28:38.440
Take it.

28:39.480 --> 28:40.520
Take it.

28:42.120 --> 28:43.080
The trading convoy

28:44.160 --> 28:45.040
has a tough road ahead.

28:47.280 --> 28:49.960
Take the money.
Go home and start a small business.

28:50.880 --> 28:52.080
Listen to me.

28:56.480 --> 28:58.240
I'll follow you, Leader.

28:58.320 --> 29:00.120
I, Cao Da, am absolutely loyal

29:00.200 --> 29:02.080
to the trading convoy.

29:02.760 --> 29:05.160
I'm willing to give my all till…

29:06.200 --> 29:07.560
till…

29:07.640 --> 29:08.840
Till your heart ceases to beat.

29:09.440 --> 29:10.560
I'm not leaving.

29:12.240 --> 29:13.240
Yes.

29:13.320 --> 29:15.160
Don't beat me.

29:15.240 --> 29:16.480
I'm not leaving either.

29:16.560 --> 29:17.800
Master, we're not leaving.

29:17.880 --> 29:19.960
-Yeah, we're not leaving.
-We're not leaving.

29:20.040 --> 29:21.280
We're not leaving.

29:21.360 --> 29:22.800
We're not leaving.

29:26.720 --> 29:28.200
I was surprised

29:28.920 --> 29:30.280
when everyone said

29:30.880 --> 29:32.360
they wouldn't leave.

29:35.280 --> 29:37.360
Yeah. I didn't expect them

29:38.120 --> 29:39.960
to be willing
to go on an adventure with me.

29:43.600 --> 29:44.920
That's because you're nice.

29:46.760 --> 29:48.560
They didn't want to leave
because you treated them well.

29:50.000 --> 29:52.280
I'll have to treat them better.

29:56.880 --> 29:58.000
Come on.

30:10.840 --> 30:12.040
Eat something.

30:13.280 --> 30:14.200
Let me ask you something.

30:14.280 --> 30:16.520
You said you were poisoned
by the Black Dragon Bandits.

30:16.600 --> 30:18.040
How's it going?

30:19.120 --> 30:20.120
I'm all right.

30:20.720 --> 30:21.920
Really?

30:22.000 --> 30:25.200
Don't worry. I'm Yan Zijing.

30:25.280 --> 30:26.280
The poison can't hurt me.

30:28.280 --> 30:30.200
-I'm worried--
-I'm all right. Don't worry.

30:31.880 --> 30:33.600
Let's eat.

30:34.920 --> 30:36.200
Don't worry.

30:36.280 --> 30:37.800
Taste this.

30:46.640 --> 30:48.120
You're erudite and informed.

30:48.200 --> 30:50.680
You're proficient in poetry,
calligraphy, and painting.

30:51.560 --> 30:53.760
I thought you were a scholar.

30:53.840 --> 30:56.560
But on your trip

30:56.640 --> 30:59.200
to the South Sea,

30:59.960 --> 31:01.240
you found out the truth about pearl diving

31:01.320 --> 31:03.120
and sympathized with the pearl divers.

31:03.200 --> 31:06.080
In your letter of expostulation,
I found your love for the people.

31:07.280 --> 31:09.280
Now, there's an opening
for a secretariat drafter.

31:09.360 --> 31:11.480
I hope you will return to Chang'an soon.

31:12.000 --> 31:14.640
I look forward to your return.

31:15.600 --> 31:17.200
Prince Ying values you.

31:17.960 --> 31:19.800
Are you going to write him back?

31:24.040 --> 31:25.200
I need to write him back.

31:27.280 --> 31:28.520
But…

31:30.880 --> 31:34.000
About the secretariat drafter,
I'll put it off.

31:34.920 --> 31:35.920
I haven't thought about it yet.

31:36.000 --> 31:39.040
It's a good thing. What are your concerns?

31:39.640 --> 31:42.360
Besides, Prince Ying
kept the position for you.

31:43.120 --> 31:44.400
It's not appropriate for you
to refuse him.

31:45.080 --> 31:47.640
I have no credit.

31:48.760 --> 31:50.160
I can't hold such an important position.

31:50.240 --> 31:52.040
I'll look into the old case

31:52.120 --> 31:53.480
and wipe out
the Black Dragon Bandits first.

31:54.240 --> 31:56.400
Then, I won't fail his trust.

31:56.480 --> 31:57.720
Prepare the ink.

31:59.800 --> 32:01.240
You're doing this for Duanwu.

32:15.880 --> 32:17.400
Dear brother.

32:17.480 --> 32:21.360
I'm going to Hexi.

32:21.440 --> 32:22.360
Yunxiu.

32:22.440 --> 32:24.520
I'll take Shrimp to you

32:24.600 --> 32:26.600
as soon as I finish the important thing.

32:27.280 --> 32:29.280
We'll find you. Wait for me.

32:30.440 --> 32:32.920
Do you remember? I told you

32:33.000 --> 32:34.560
that we would open a shop.

32:34.640 --> 32:37.160
You'll carve jade. I'll sell them.
Remember?

32:37.240 --> 32:38.600
Yes.

32:38.680 --> 32:40.960
Can we have our own shop, Duanwu?

32:41.040 --> 32:43.320
Duanwu, are we going to open a shop?

32:44.200 --> 32:46.120
You have a good ear.

32:46.800 --> 32:48.680
It's great.

32:49.280 --> 32:50.120
Duanwu.

32:50.200 --> 32:52.480
What do we name our shop?

32:53.080 --> 32:54.600
Name our shop?

33:01.640 --> 33:03.480
May my heart be as bright as the moon.

33:05.040 --> 33:06.560
So I can see through people.

33:08.200 --> 33:09.360
Is it good?

33:10.800 --> 33:12.480
Let's name it…

33:15.800 --> 33:17.720
Clear Mind, okay?

33:18.520 --> 33:20.440
-Clear Mind.
-How about it?

33:20.520 --> 33:21.400
-Okay.
-Alright.

33:21.480 --> 33:22.840
Duanwu.

33:22.920 --> 33:24.480
Let's go to Yangzhou then.

33:24.560 --> 33:25.840
Why?

33:25.920 --> 33:28.880
Yangzhou is prosperous.
There are many jewelry shops.

33:28.960 --> 33:30.800
We can make a difference.

33:55.280 --> 33:59.720
CUI

34:17.000 --> 34:20.960
YAN

34:34.639 --> 34:38.040
BIANZHOU

34:38.120 --> 34:40.199
It's delicious. Have some.

34:40.280 --> 34:41.760
No, thanks.

34:42.880 --> 34:43.960
Stop eating.

34:44.040 --> 34:46.199
Shrimp. There's a flowerpot there.

34:46.280 --> 34:47.880
Let's see who gets there first.

34:47.960 --> 34:49.320
This is the starting line.

34:49.400 --> 34:51.040
Three, two.

34:51.120 --> 34:52.360
-Wait.
-Excuse me.

34:52.440 --> 34:55.199
-Wait. This line.
-Three, two, one, start.

34:57.200 --> 34:58.760
I got there first.

34:58.840 --> 35:00.680
I'm the first.

35:02.000 --> 35:03.000
Call Duanwu.

35:03.080 --> 35:04.480
Duanwu.

35:04.560 --> 35:05.960
Duanwu.

35:06.040 --> 35:07.960
-Come here. These flowers are beautiful.
-Duanwu, come here.

35:08.040 --> 35:09.000
Duanwu.

35:09.640 --> 35:11.960
-Coming.
-Mine looks better.

35:12.040 --> 35:14.640
Can you keep up with her?
Could you be positive?

35:14.720 --> 35:15.720
She's shy.

35:15.800 --> 35:16.920
This one looks better.

35:17.000 --> 35:18.680
Are you also shy?

35:18.760 --> 35:20.560
-This one is beautiful.
-I'm not shy.

35:20.640 --> 35:21.840
-I should consider her feelings.
-What kind of flower is this?

35:21.920 --> 35:23.440
Look at that.

35:23.520 --> 35:25.280
I've never seen this flower.

35:25.360 --> 35:26.680
What kind of flower is this? It's so big.

35:26.760 --> 35:28.840
Miss, it's a peony.

35:28.920 --> 35:30.200
As a line of poetry goes,

35:30.280 --> 35:31.760
"Peonies are the most beautiful flowers.

35:31.840 --> 35:33.120
When the peonies bloom,

35:33.200 --> 35:34.280
people from all over the capital
will go to watch them."

35:36.040 --> 35:38.360
Duanwu,
we haven't been to the capital yet.

35:38.440 --> 35:39.520
We'll go there sooner or later.

35:39.600 --> 35:41.280
Yes. We'll get a chance to go together.

35:41.360 --> 35:42.840
She said she would go to the capital.

35:42.920 --> 35:44.640
-Duanwu, look at this flower.
-I'll keep that in mind.

35:44.720 --> 35:46.120
It looks beautiful.

35:46.920 --> 35:48.320
The purple flowers are beautiful, too.

36:09.440 --> 36:10.560
What?

36:15.240 --> 36:16.360
What's wrong?

36:17.320 --> 36:19.240
-Shrimp, look at this flower.
-Duanwu.

36:20.560 --> 36:22.600
The master is acting weird.

36:22.680 --> 36:24.480
He's staring at you all the time.

36:26.840 --> 36:29.320
Look at him. Look at his eyes.

36:29.400 --> 36:30.880
I've been watching him for a long time.

36:32.120 --> 36:33.600
Is he…?

36:36.960 --> 36:39.120
Shrimp, here's the thing.

36:39.200 --> 36:40.840
Is he trying to kill you?

36:42.920 --> 36:43.840
Why would you say that?

36:43.920 --> 36:45.640
Is he trying to kill you again?

36:45.720 --> 36:47.040
What have you done lately?

36:47.640 --> 36:50.480
Does he look like he wants to kill me?

36:50.560 --> 36:51.560
I don't think so.

36:52.200 --> 36:53.440
What do you think?

36:53.520 --> 36:54.600
Let me see.

36:54.680 --> 36:55.920
He wants to kill you?

36:57.280 --> 36:58.640
Don't look at him. It's dangerous.

37:06.640 --> 37:08.760
Accountant Wei,
what has Duanwu done lately?

37:08.840 --> 37:10.280
She hasn't done anything wrong.

37:11.840 --> 37:13.240
You're also acting weird.

37:16.320 --> 37:17.800
What's wrong with me?

37:17.880 --> 37:19.440
Duanwu.

37:20.320 --> 37:22.000
Come here. This flower is beautiful.

37:22.800 --> 37:24.560
It would look great on you.

37:25.160 --> 37:26.280
Come here. I'll put it on for you.

37:26.360 --> 37:28.640
Wait. Accountant Wei,
why did you take it off?

37:28.720 --> 37:29.960
-It's okay.
-We have to pay for it.

37:30.040 --> 37:31.480
Never mind.

37:31.560 --> 37:33.720
I can't put it on for you.

37:33.800 --> 37:34.920
Who knows how to wear this?

37:35.000 --> 37:35.880
I'll do it.

37:37.680 --> 37:38.720
What does it have to do with you?

37:38.800 --> 37:40.640
-Put it back.
-I've taken it down.

37:53.000 --> 37:54.480
-I'll put it on for you.
-Do you know how to put it on?

37:54.560 --> 37:55.440
Of course.

37:55.520 --> 37:56.720
-Really?
-Yes.

37:57.320 --> 37:58.480
You can try.

38:08.520 --> 38:09.520
Are you done?

38:10.680 --> 38:11.520
So soon.

38:12.800 --> 38:13.640
It's beautiful.

38:15.960 --> 38:17.440
Probably because the flower is beautiful.

38:25.600 --> 38:26.800
The flower is beautiful.

38:32.200 --> 38:33.280
Well…

38:34.360 --> 38:37.280
I think I smelled Cao Da's chicken feet.

38:37.360 --> 38:39.080
-Did you smell it?
-Yes.

38:39.720 --> 38:40.560
It smells good.

38:41.640 --> 38:42.840
Where is he? Why didn't I smell it?

38:42.920 --> 38:44.400
-Let me see what he's eating.
-Okay.

38:44.480 --> 38:46.760
-Good job. Thank you.
-You're welcome.

38:50.280 --> 38:51.320
Let's go together.

38:52.320 --> 38:53.200
Go.

38:54.920 --> 38:55.960
Duanwu.

38:58.840 --> 39:00.880
Nice. Good for you.

39:03.920 --> 39:04.840
Take notes.

39:04.920 --> 39:07.320
Come on. That's all for your dishes.

39:07.400 --> 39:08.720
Are you leaving?

39:08.800 --> 39:10.040
-Take care.
-Wow.

39:10.120 --> 39:13.760
This is our specialty wine, Museles.

39:13.840 --> 39:14.760
I know this wine.

39:14.840 --> 39:16.640
It's a nice grape wine. It's great.

39:16.720 --> 39:17.760
Smell it.

39:17.840 --> 39:19.520
It smells like grapes.

39:20.480 --> 39:22.520
Let's toast

39:22.600 --> 39:23.840
to our arrival in Bianzhou.

39:23.920 --> 39:26.720
-A cup of Muse…
-Museles.

39:26.800 --> 39:27.800
Museles.

39:28.680 --> 39:30.680
-Let's make a toast.
-Cheers.

39:30.760 --> 39:32.640
-Cheers.
-Here.

39:35.840 --> 39:37.080
Nice.

39:37.160 --> 39:38.160
You only eat bones.

39:38.240 --> 39:40.480
Can I have a bone?

39:40.560 --> 39:41.880
Don't use your hands.

39:41.960 --> 39:44.840
-That's all for your dishes.
-Thank you, Kang.

39:44.920 --> 39:46.240
-What are you looking at?
-Let me toast you.

39:47.760 --> 39:49.120
It's delicious.

39:49.200 --> 39:50.960
-I'm looking at the owner.
-Save some for me.

39:51.040 --> 39:52.360
This is a big restaurant.

39:52.440 --> 39:53.760
There are three floors here.

39:53.840 --> 39:55.880
-Shrimp, this is your favorite.
-It's good for a woman

39:55.960 --> 39:56.800
-to own such a restaurant.
-Okay.

39:56.880 --> 39:58.360
-Cao Da.
-Give it to me.

39:58.440 --> 39:59.400
What's good about it?

40:00.400 --> 40:01.920
Isn't it good?

40:02.000 --> 40:04.800
A woman does what she wants.

40:04.880 --> 40:05.960
Cao Da.

40:06.040 --> 40:07.400
And she's doing it well.

40:08.080 --> 40:08.960
I envy her.

40:09.040 --> 40:09.920
Shrimp, eat more.

40:10.000 --> 40:10.920
You can do it, too.

40:11.000 --> 40:11.920
Cao Da, you eat more.

40:12.000 --> 40:12.880
Me?

40:14.360 --> 40:16.240
I just want to be a peddler.

40:16.320 --> 40:18.080
Being a boss…

40:20.800 --> 40:23.400
How about this? You'll be the boss,

40:23.480 --> 40:26.640
-and I will rely on you.
-What?

40:27.240 --> 40:28.960
You'll be the boss. I'll rely on you.

40:29.040 --> 40:30.680
You rely on me?

40:30.760 --> 40:32.240
I'll be the boss?

40:32.320 --> 40:34.480
-You rely on me?
-I rely on you.

40:34.560 --> 40:35.840
-You rely on me?
-Yes.

40:35.920 --> 40:38.000
You rely on me?

40:38.080 --> 40:39.000
Yes.

40:49.280 --> 40:51.360
We were just talking about my itchiness.

40:57.320 --> 40:58.480
Leader.

40:58.560 --> 41:00.720
Have you and the master…?

41:07.360 --> 41:08.480
Is it that obvious?

41:11.840 --> 41:14.320
-You're strong.
-Well…

41:15.520 --> 41:17.400
In that case,

41:18.680 --> 41:19.800
I won't hide it from you.

41:22.520 --> 41:24.320
I wish you happiness.

41:24.400 --> 41:25.480
I wish you all the best.

41:25.560 --> 41:28.160
I wish…

41:28.240 --> 41:29.840
My sister and brother-in-law…

41:29.920 --> 41:31.600
-Brother-in-law.
-I wish you a bright future,

41:31.680 --> 41:33.160
a happy life,

41:33.240 --> 41:34.480
every success,

41:34.560 --> 41:35.480
good fortune,

41:35.560 --> 41:36.920
and all the best.

41:37.000 --> 41:38.240
-Yeah!
-Good.

41:38.320 --> 41:39.280
I wish you a long life together.

41:39.360 --> 41:40.440
Good.

41:41.320 --> 41:42.240
I hope you

41:42.320 --> 41:44.640
raise your cups and get what you want,

41:44.720 --> 41:47.520
clink your cups and make a lot of money,

41:47.600 --> 41:49.320
and drink it up and live a rich life.

41:53.360 --> 41:54.920
-Come on.
-You'll get rich.

41:55.000 --> 41:56.160
We'll get rich.

41:56.880 --> 41:57.920
-Come on.
-Come on.

41:59.840 --> 42:01.800
Brother-in-law, I have a request.

42:01.880 --> 42:04.680
I want my sister to be happy forever.

42:04.760 --> 42:06.200
Don't bully her.

42:06.280 --> 42:08.360
Don't worry. I can do that.

42:08.440 --> 42:09.440
But…

42:10.520 --> 42:11.800
she's bullying me.

42:13.320 --> 42:15.120
Duanwu, don't bully him.

42:16.520 --> 42:17.360
-Wait. Am I your sister?
-Yeah.

42:17.440 --> 42:18.960
Don't bully me.

42:19.040 --> 42:19.880
Duanwu.

42:21.360 --> 42:22.640
Supervisor Kang.

42:22.720 --> 42:25.400
I haven't seen Zijing this happy

42:25.480 --> 42:27.320
in a long time.

42:29.920 --> 42:33.200
I sincerely wish you happiness forever.

42:33.280 --> 42:34.880
I'll take good care of him.

42:34.960 --> 42:36.480
-Here's to you.
-Thank you, Supervisor Kang.

42:37.600 --> 42:38.920
Don't be sentimental.

42:39.680 --> 42:40.960
Don't be sentimental.

42:41.040 --> 42:42.120
-Come on.
-Cheers.

42:42.200 --> 42:43.320
Cheers.
